ore/load both slots + re-registers the loaded ptr len. Producer perl5-son pu (stash-store RHS-repr stamp). floor 134->136. round-2 t/base blockers flipped GREEN: T6 mid-body last (extra exit-Region predecessor), T7 next (reframed as if(!C){rest}), T9 stmt-modifier-in-arm, F5/F6 direct-call-with-args (SSA arg-binding during inline; the t/op is/ok unlocker), A16/A17/A18 package-var read+store (fixed a latent dropped-store miscompile; module i64 global). T8 (value-ctx ternary into element store) remains a declared GAP. Also fixed a loader topo bug (a merge-Phi Region emitted after its Phi lost its region). Producer: perl5-son pu. floor 126->134. the 6 t/base blocker GAPs are now GREEN: T1 list-context ternary (print $c ? "y" : "n" via a TernaryExpr over Str branches -- select ptr + len), T2 die-in-branch-arm (die lowers to an Unwind -> exit+unreachable; taken-die aborts exit 255, not-taken returns the other arm), T3 cond_expr-in-loop-body (dispatch to _handle_cond_expr from the loop-body walk), T4 last-in-loop-body (head-of-body last if hoisted as a negated loop header), L6 StrEq / L7 StrNe (length-guard + memcmp byte compare). Producer: perl5-son pu. floor 116->126. t/ blocker corpus: 6 GAP-declared cases pin the measured t/base blockers (T1 list-context ternary, T2 die-in-branch-arm, T3 cond_expr-in-loop-body, T4 last-in-loop-body, L6 StrEq, L7 StrNe) as regression-locked boundary markers that flip GAP->GREEN as each feature lands, plus 2 GREEN near-misses whose SIMPLE form already lowers (T5 direct no-arg named-sub call -> Int:42; L8 void call in an `and` arm -> stdout y + Int:1) -- the t/ files hit harder variants (Test::More `is` with no callee graph; an `and` arm mixing a void call with a scalar rebind) that still GAP. floor 114 -> 116. Prior: side-effecting loop condition lands: a `while` CONDITION that mutates a pad slot (`while ($i-- > 0)`) runs its mutation on the failing (N+1th) evaluation too, so the post-loop read must observe the AT-EXIT value, not the he